('sahuagin','Sahuagin','Sahuagin','2','Medium','Monstrous Humanoid (Aquatic)','Usually lawful evil','2d8+2 (11 hp)',11,'+1','30 ft. (6 squares), swim 60 ft.','16 (+1 Dex, +5 natural), touch 11, flat-footed 15','+2/+4','Talon +4 melee (1d4+2) or trident +4 melee (1d8+3) or heavy crossbow +3 ranged (1d10/19–20)','5 ft./5 ft.','+3','+4','+4',14,13,12,14,13,9,'Handle Animal +4*, Hide +6*, Listen +6*, Profession (hunter) +1*, Ride +3, Spot +6*, Survival +1*','Great Fortitude, MultiattackB','{"special_attacks":"Blood frenzy, rake 1d4+1","special_qualities":"Blindsense 30 ft., darkvision 60 ft., freshwater sensitivity, light blindness, speak with sharks, water dependent"}'::jsonb,'Most sahuagin feature green coloration, darker along the back and lighter on the belly. Many have dark stripes, bands, or spots, but these tend to fade with age. An adult male sahuagin stands roughly 6 feet tall and weighs about 200 pounds.

Sahuagin are the natural enemy of aquatic elves. The two cannot coexist peacefully: Wars between them are prolonged, bloody affairs that sometimes interfere with shipping and maritime trade. Sahuagin have an only slightly less vehement hatred for tritons.

Sahuagin speak their own language, Sahuagin. Thanks to their high Intelligence scores, most sahuagin also speak two bonus languages, usually Common and Aquan.','{"full_attack":"Trident +4 melee (1d8+3) and bite +2 melee (1d4+1); or 2 talons +4 melee (1d4+2) and bite +2 melee (1d4+1); or heavy crossbow +3 ranged (1d10/19–20)","statblock":{"hit_dice":"2d8+2 (11 hp)","hit_points":11,"base_attack_grapple":"+2/+4","attack":"Talon +4 melee (1d4+2) or trident +4 melee (1d8+3) or heavy crossbow +3 ranged (1d10/19–20)","full_attack":"Trident +4 melee (1d8+3) and bite +2 melee (1d4+1); or 2 talons +4 melee (1d4+2) and bite +2 melee (1d4+1); or heavy crossbow +3 ranged (1d10/19–20)","space_reach":"5 ft./5 ft.","saves":"Fort +3, Ref +4, Will +4","abilities":{"str":"14","dex":"13","con":"12","int":"14","wis":"13","cha":"9"},"skills":"Handle Animal +4*, Hide +6*, Listen +6*, Profession (hunter) +1*, Ride +3, Spot +6*, Survival +1*","feats":"Great Fortitude, MultiattackB","special_attacks":"Blood frenzy, rake 1d4+1","special_qualities":"Blindsense 30 ft., darkvision 60 ft., freshwater sensitivity, light blindness, speak with sharks, water dependent"},"source_file":"monsters-s.md","source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md"}'::jsonb,'https://olimot.github.io/srd-v3.5/monsters/monsters-s.html',true),
